---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, brandName, isRented, RENTER, activePhone, telHref } from '../config/site.js';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy', url: '/privacy/' }];
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${brandName()} handles calls, voicemails and site visits.`} crumbs={crumbs}>
  <section><div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated {SITE.updated}</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>This site has no forms and doesn't ask for your email address. When you call or leave a voicemail, we receive your phone number and whatever you tell us (such as your name, city and what's going on with your roof). We also receive basic technical data any website receives (such as your browser type and pages visited) through our hosting provider. If we use analytics or call tracking, they record visits and calls to measure how the site is used.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To respond to your call{isRented() ? ` (calls go to ${RENTER.businessName})` : ', including passing your message to one independent, Oregon CCB-licensed roofer serving your area so they can reach you'}.</li>
      <li>To call you back about your roof.</li>
      <li>To keep the site working and improve it.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What we don't do</h2>
    <p>We don't sell your information, and we don't share it with multiple contractors to bid against each other.</p>
    <h2>Phone calls</h2>
    <p>Calls to the number on this site may be routed through a call-tracking service and may be recorded, and voicemails are stored by that service, to confirm calls were handled and to count how many calls the site receives.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>Ask us to delete your voicemail and call details, or to stop contacting you, at any time: {SITE.email ? <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> : <a href={telHref()}>{activePhone().display}</a>}.</p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site isn't directed at children under 13 and we don't knowingly collect their information.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We'll update this page if our practices change.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
